u2082 + 6H\\\\u2082O \\\\u2192 C\\\\u2086H\\\\u2081\\\\u2082O\\\\u2086 + 6O\\\\u2082)\",\\n      \"Cellular respiration\",\\n      \"Chloroplast structure at the molecular level\",\\n      \"Light-dependent and light-independent reactions\",\\n      \"Quantitative limiting factors\"\\n    ],\\n    \"objective\": \"Identify that plants are producers because they make their own food, unlike animals that eat other living things.\",\\n    \"subject\": \"Science\"\\n  },\\n  \"neighbours\": {\\n    \"after\": \"Target the misconception that plants absorb food from the soil through their roots (M1). Pose a scenario or question where a learner might choose that plants \\'eat soil\\' vs. \\'make food\\'. Use the approved multiple-choice item i1 to let a learner holding that belief reveal it, then correct using the sunflower\\'s process.\",\\n    \"before\": \"\"\\n  },\\n  \"section_context\": {\\n    \"section_id\": \"contrast\"\\n  },\\n  \"terminology\": [\\n    \"producer\",\\n    \"photosynthesis\",\\n    \"chlorophyll\",\\n    \"carbon dioxide\",\\n    \"oxygen\",\\n    \"sugar\"\\n  ],\\n  \"writer_contract\": {\\n    \"capacity\": {\\n      \"captionMaxWords\": 20,\\n      \"columnsMax\": 4,\\n      \"columnsMin\": 2,\\n      \"rowsMax\": 8,\\n      \"rowsMin\": 2,\\n      \"wordsPerCell\": 12\\n    },\\n    \"catalogue_version\": \"1.1.0\",\\n    \"content_schema\": {\\n      \"caption\": \"string|null\",\\n      \"columns\": \"TableColumn[]\",\\n      \"presentation\": \"standard|comparison|timeline\",\\n      \"rows\": \"TableRow[]\"\\n    },\\n    \"failure_examples\": [],\\n    \"generation_guidance\": \"\",\\n    \"object_id\": \"table\",\\n    \"object_validation\": []\\n  }\\n}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': \"Return JSON only for this block's content schema.\"}], 'model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'max_completion_tokens': 120000, 'stream': False}}"}
